              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijwi ry’ūvuga, ati Semerera. Uwundi ati Nsemerere iki? Ut’ Abafise umubiri bose n’ivyatsi gusa, n’ubgiza bgabo bgose bumeze nk’amashurwe yo ku musozi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ivyatsi birūma, amashurwe agakabirana, kukw impwemu z’Uhoraho zībihūhako: n’ukuri abantu n’ivyatsi gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyatsi birūma, amashurwe agakabirana, arikw ijambo ry’Imana yacu rizohorah’ ibihe bidashira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
