              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimwaribgabimenye? Ntimwaribgavyumve? Ntimwaribgabibarirwe uhereye mbere na mbere? Ntimwaribgabitahure uhereye ah’ itanguriro ry’isi ryashiriweho? ",
          "type": "text",
